font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >表</font> <font face="宋体" >11　替代评价指标建议</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(68,68,68);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >其中</font><font face="宋体" >“主轴功率”灵敏度最高</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >：它直接反映切削力，不受表面形貌噪声干扰，开</font> <font face="宋体" >/ 关超声的差异具有确定性与可重复性。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;
color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="黑体" >7.3　若需验证刀柄在难切削材料上的能力</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;
font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >建议改用</font> </span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >45 钢或 304 不锈钢薄板</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >，其余参数保持不变。超声在钢及不锈钢上的效应量通常为铝的</font> <font face="宋体" >3–5 倍，更易获得显著结果。若该刀柄的技术定位为“加工难切削材料”，则铝并非合适的验证对象。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;
color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="黑体" >八、报告摘要</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;
font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >本实验在</font> <font face="宋体" >0.5 mm 铝薄板边缘周铣工况下，系统考察了超声（纵扭复合，20 kHz，纵振 10 &#956;m / 扭振 7 &#956;m）开启与关闭对表面粗糙度 Ra 的影响，覆盖 3000–6000 rpm 四个转速水平，共获得 30 组有效数据。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >结果表明：</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(244,244,244);mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >超声开启与关闭的</font> <font face="宋体" >Ra 均值分别为 3.691 &#956;m 与 3.688 &#956;m，差值仅 0.003 &#956;m（0.08%），统计上无显著差异（p ≈ 0.98，95% 置信区间 &#8722;0.28 ~ +0.29 &#956;m）</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >相比之下，</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(244,244,244);mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >同一条件的重复性误差达</font> <font face="宋体" >0.55–0.85 &#956;m，约为超声效应的 200 倍</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >，表明本实验系统的噪声水平不足以分辨该量级的效应。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >转速是唯一显示出趋势的变量：</font><font face="宋体" >3000 → 5000 rpm 使 Ra 下降约 10%，超过 5000 rpm 后趋于平稳。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >分析认为，</font><font face="宋体" >Ra 未响应超声的根本原因在于：</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(244,244,244);mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >Ra 基线偏高（3.7 &#956;m，为铝精铣正常值的 2–4 倍）且对每齿进给不敏感，说明表面形成主要受 0.5 mm 薄板让刀、磁吸局部悬空及积屑瘤等非超声因素控制</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >；此外，小振幅超声系统在切削负载下的振幅衰减亦可能是重要原因。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:13.1000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:13.1000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(244,244,244);mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >建议：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(244,244,244);
mso-shading:rgb(244,244,244);" ><font face="宋体" >后续实验应优先改善工件支撑与润滑以降低基线（目标</font> <font face="宋体" >Ra ≤ 2.0 &#956;m），并将评价指标改为主轴功率或毛刺高度；若需验证刀柄在难切削材料上的能力，建议改用钢 / 不锈钢试件。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="margin-top:24.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(85,85,85);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >说明：本报告数据来源于现场实测，统计方法为双样本均值比较（合并标准差</font> <font face="宋体" >t 检验），置信区间按 95% 水平计算。所有 Ra 值单位为 &#956;m，测量仪器分辨率不低于 0.001 &#956;m。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>